      "content": "it's just hard to see the \"seeds\" when everything feels so heavy. i've been trying to channel this into my songwriting, but it feels like the only way to actually capture the truth of it is through something more... final. like, if the art is supposed to be a reflection of life, what happens when life itself feels like the very thing that's obstructing the art?",
